{
  "name" : "Hu2018 - Dynamics of tumor-CD4+-cytokine-host cells interactions with treatments",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a proposed mathematical model describing interactions between tumor cells, CD4+ T cells, cytokines, and host cells within the context of CD4+ T cells inducing tumor regression. A platform is provided to assess the effectiveness of single or combination therapy with CD4+ T cells and/or cytokines.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
    "name" : "SBML",
    "identifier" : "SBML",
